{
    "_doc": "Plausibility contract for ConditionsService.php and enotfConditions.ts (tests/Unit/Enotf/ConditionsServiceTest.php, tests/js/enotfConditions.test.ts). L01-L21 = the 21 legacy cases (plugins/enotf/tests/Unit/CrewConditionsServiceTest.php), E1-E12 edge cases (E9-E12: medis rows or the confirmation medis_keine, 9b). A case: values (flat legacy keys, page form conventions) or extends 'full' + set/unset. Expectations: violations ('rule:field', order-insensitive), violation_count, counts (violations per section), active_count/active (rules for values.transportziel), sections (fill state: status string or exact object), section_order. Sections are page slugs (FieldSchema), not the legacy numbers.",
